---
description: How this team writes tests
globs: **/src/test/**/*.java
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use JUnit 5 and AssertJ assertions.
- Use @WebMvcTest for controller tests and @DataJpaTest for repository tests.
- Use Mockito for collaborators. Don't mock the Spring Security filter chain.
- Name tests after the behavior they check, for example shouldReturnOwnerWhenIdExists.